{
    "background_story": "Uriel, the angel of knowledge, was often depicted with a staff made from the sacred apium plant. According to legend, the apium's unique properties allowed Uriel to channel the divine wisdom of the heavens. With his staff in hand, Uriel would roam the realms, sharing his insight with those who sought truth and understanding. His presence was said to be accompanied by the sweet, pungent aroma of the apium, which was believed to purify the mind and clarify the thoughts. As a messenger of the divine, Uriel used the apium's power to guide humanity towards enlightenment, earning him the reverence of many as a guardian of wisdom and a beacon of light in the spiritual realm.",
